    "parishPhoneNumber": "0683170116",
    "history": "Formation and Early Days (1980s - 1990s)\nBuza Parish, officially known as St. Joseph Buza Catholic Parish, is located in the Temeke District of Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. The parish was established in the late 1980s as a response to the growing number of Catholic faithful in the Buza area who previously traveled long distances to attend Mass at larger parishes like Mbagala and Temeke.\n\nThe early church community began with small gatherings under trees and temporary shelters, with services often conducted by priests from neighboring parishes on rotational visits.",
