    "email": "thomasakwino@gmail.com",
    "parishPhoneNumber": "0683170116",
    "history": "The St. Thomas Aquinas University Parish, located at the University of Dar es Salaam (UDSM), was established to serve the spiritual needs of Catholic students, staff, and the surrounding university community. It is named after St. Thomas Aquinas, the patron saint of scholars, reflecting its academic environment and commitment to intellectual and spiritual growth.\n\nThe parish began informally in the early years of the university's establishment in the 1960s, when Catholic students and staff gathered for Mass and fellowship. With the growth of the university and increasing number of Catholic faithful, the need for a structured and formal parish became evident. The Archdiocese of Dar es Salaam responded by formally recognizing the community and assigning pastoral leadership.",
